    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνδουλ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fellow-slave</i>, masc., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				745
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Com.
				32.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				331
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				5.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				18.29
			</span></i>, etc.; fem., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				65
			</span></i>, etc.; also fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδούλη</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.110
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				3.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph. in
				<i>NT,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Col.
				1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Apoc.</u>
				6.11
			</span></i>, al. (The statement of Moeris <i><span class="en">
				p.273
			</span></i> P., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμόδουλος Ἀττικῶς, σύνδουλος
				Ἑλληνικῶς</span>, is incorrect: <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.82
			</span></i> distinguishes <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς</span>. 'slave of the
			same master' fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμόδουλος</span>
			'companion in slavery'.)</div>
